WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.100
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:00.163 --> 00:02.092
(Supported by KOCCA)

3
00:02.093 --> 00:03.832
(All people, incidents, and backgrounds are fictitious.)

4
00:03.833 --> 00:05.133
(Children were filmed under production guidelines.)

5
00:51.313 --> 00:52.313
Welcome...

6
00:54.483 --> 00:56.383
Goodbye.

7
01:13.303 --> 01:15.132
Welcome...

8
01:15.133 --> 01:17.003
- You are here? - Yes.

9
01:17.603 --> 01:19.573
Hey, hurry up and go. You will be late.

10
01:19.613 --> 01:22.743
- Good work. - Did you get some sleep?

11
01:22.813 --> 01:26.053
Do not even ask. My daughter was crying all night...

12
01:26.113 --> 01:27.383
because she missed her mom.

13
01:27.413 --> 01:30.223
My wife was crying because she felt bad for our first child.

14
01:30.283 --> 01:32.693
Man, I want to cry too.

15
01:32.953 --> 01:36.323
- When is she leaving the center? - She still has two days left.

16
01:37.163 --> 01:38.663
But I am worried about when she comes back.

17
01:39.863 --> 01:41.293
Hurry up and go. You will be late.

18
01:41.363 --> 01:42.733
Okay.

19
01:42.803 --> 01:43.803
Yes.

20
01:45.203 --> 01:46.973
I finished the closing duties.

21
01:47.033 --> 01:48.973
The spoonable yogurt does not sell well,

22
01:49.043 --> 01:50.973
so I did not order any today.

23
01:51.003 --> 01:52.513
Good job.

24
01:56.683 --> 01:59.883
I am sorry for making you work the night shift on an important day.

25
01:59.913 --> 02:01.213
If you are sorry...

26
02:01.753 --> 02:03.083
This is my breakfast.

27
02:14.933 --> 02:15.963
I am exhausted.

28
02:27.513 --> 02:28.913
(B202, 5 minutes)

29
02:29.913 --> 02:30.913
Five minutes?

30
02:33.853 --> 02:35.683
(Do you want to look for a house together?)

31
02:35.753 --> 02:36.983
(Onbang)

32
02:43.023 --> 02:44.263
(Try it on!)

33
02:46.663 --> 02:48.433
Thank you.

34
03:12.393 --> 03:13.623
Boarding.

35
03:24.303 --> 03:25.303
Sorry.

36
03:29.173 --> 03:30.543
("'I Didn't Know Back Then' Press Premiere D-Day")

37
03:30.603 --> 03:31.843
("TV Star Tak Mu I, Can He Hit it Big on Screen?")

38
03:31.903 --> 03:33.143
("Concerns Surrounding Him")

39
03:33.813 --> 03:36.043
I have done plenty of press premieres for dramas.

40
03:38.383 --> 03:40.413
Why am I so nervous?

41
03:40.513 --> 03:42.213
Group blind dates and one-on-one blind dates...

42
03:42.283 --> 03:44.353
are both nerve-racking.

43
03:44.783 --> 03:46.693
Is that supposed to be a metaphor?

44
03:47.093 --> 03:49.493
I am equally scared of reporters and women.

45
03:49.563 --> 03:51.393
No matter what I say, they do not laugh or cry.

46
03:51.463 --> 03:53.933
It is like they are betting on who can keep a straighter face.

47
03:53.993 --> 03:57.303
I wonder why. You have so much charm,

48
03:57.363 --> 03:59.203
so why are you not popular with women?

49
03:59.273 --> 04:03.003
You act so well, so why do the reporters hate you?

50
04:04.643 --> 04:05.643
Let us stop.

51
04:07.213 --> 04:08.713
The director changed halfway through,

52
04:08.773 --> 04:10.213
and one actor dropped out due to school bullying.

53
04:10.283 --> 04:12.413
But despite all that, the movie is still premiering.

54
04:14.113 --> 04:16.453
- It has to. - Yes.

55
04:16.783 --> 04:17.853
Let us go.

56
04:24.123 --> 04:25.123
Are you nervous?

57
04:26.433 --> 04:28.793
Yes, I am a little nervous.

58
04:28.893 --> 04:31.103
You won the Presidential Award at the Manhae Writing Contest.

59
04:31.163 --> 04:32.163
(Everybody Dairy New Hire Interview)

60
04:32.233 --> 04:33.873
Did you get into college with this?

61
04:33.903 --> 04:36.203
Yes, I was admitted through special admission.

62
04:36.303 --> 04:37.603
Why did you not continue writing?

63
04:38.773 --> 04:40.873
I felt like it was not my path.

64
04:40.973 --> 04:43.613
Oh, my. With this level of award history,

65
04:43.683 --> 04:45.043
it is hard to say it is not your path.

66
04:46.113 --> 04:48.213
Your TOEIC score just passed the cutoff.

67
04:48.283 --> 04:52.223
Zero internship experience. Zero study abroad experience.

68
04:52.353 --> 04:53.993
Your GPA is 4.45.

69
04:55.323 --> 04:56.823
I guess you only studied?

70
04:56.863 --> 04:58.693
Yes, I really needed to get a scholarship,

71
04:58.763 --> 05:00.133
so I worked hard.

72
05:00.163 --> 05:02.933
And although I could not do an internship or study abroad,

73
05:02.963 --> 05:05.333
I pride myself on having done every part-time job out there.

74
05:05.363 --> 05:06.903
Essay tutoring, serving,

75
05:06.973 --> 05:09.243
convenience stores, handing out flyers, call centers,

76
05:09.303 --> 05:11.073
and even helping kids after school.

77
05:11.103 --> 05:13.073
It seems you did not get any help from your parents.

78
05:14.643 --> 05:17.143
To be exact, I did not accept any.

79
05:17.213 --> 05:18.383
That is impressive.

80
05:18.443 --> 05:20.652
Do you have a reason for applying to our company?

81
05:20.653 --> 05:23.483
There were many other places considered dream jobs.

82
05:23.553 --> 05:27.453
I liked the corporate mindset of Everybody Dairy...

83
05:27.523 --> 05:30.793
where producers, workers, and consumers are all happy.

84
05:30.863 --> 05:33.163
Also, since I was young, my mother told me...

85
05:33.233 --> 05:36.633
that I grew up drinking this company's formula and milk.

86
05:36.733 --> 05:38.703
Since you raised me this much,

87
05:38.733 --> 05:42.333
I wanted to be of help in growing the company now,

88
05:42.403 --> 05:43.743
which is why I applied.

89
05:44.843 --> 05:48.073
You applied for the HR department. Is there a reason?

90
05:48.143 --> 05:50.443
I like people,

91
05:50.513 --> 05:52.713
and as the saying goes, HR is everything,

92
05:52.783 --> 05:55.153
so I thought it might be the most important job.

93
05:55.183 --> 05:57.123
That job requires you not to get too attached to people.

94
05:57.183 --> 05:59.693
If you just hire me, I will work hard.

95
06:01.993 --> 06:04.363
- Thank you, everyone. - Thank you for your hard work.

96
06:04.423 --> 06:05.963
Thank you for your time.

97
06:06.033 --> 06:08.133
By the way, Ms. Gong Yu Il.

98
06:08.163 --> 06:10.603
I really enjoyed reading your cover letter.

99
06:11.103 --> 06:14.273
Oh, the story about the bamboo...

100
06:14.333 --> 06:16.443
that does not break because it is hollow and has joints.

101
06:16.503 --> 06:18.503
While everyone else is busy showing off...

102
06:18.573 --> 06:20.643
their strengths, skills, and experience,

103
06:20.713 --> 06:24.683
you wrote about the pain, sadness, and frustration in your joints.

104
06:24.883 --> 06:26.213
It was truly impressive.

105
06:27.313 --> 06:30.153
You are confident you will not break, right?

106
06:30.183 --> 06:31.953
Yes, thank you.

107
06:32.283 --> 06:33.693
- It was a pleasure. - Good job.

108
06:33.753 --> 06:34.753
Good job.

109
07:03.823 --> 07:04.983
No!

110
07:07.453 --> 07:08.653
No...

111
07:11.723 --> 07:13.433
(Cast)

112
07:13.493 --> 07:14.833
(Ji Hoon, Tak Mu I)

113
07:14.893 --> 07:15.963
How was it?

114
07:17.263 --> 07:20.333
(Cast)

115
07:21.333 --> 07:22.333
It was boring.

116
07:42.993 --> 07:44.223
Is it raining there?

117
07:44.963 --> 07:47.033
No, I am watering the plants.

118
07:47.493 --> 07:49.203
You are not watering them with your tears?

119
07:50.333 --> 07:53.973
I skipped watering for one day, and the soil is already so dry.

120
07:54.373 --> 07:55.903
Tell me the truth.

121
07:55.973 --> 07:58.303
The money in your pockets is drying up too, right?

122
07:59.543 --> 08:00.743
What?

123
08:01.313 --> 08:02.683
What is this?

124
08:03.313 --> 08:04.912
- Speak of the devil. - Yes.

125
08:04.913 --> 08:06.453
How did you get here at this hour?

126
08:06.483 --> 08:09.013
I had to meet your landlord for a location scout.

127
08:10.723 --> 08:12.823
I went to check out a rooftop apartment for filming,

128
08:12.893 --> 08:15.623
and it was surrounded by buildings on three sides.

129
08:16.163 --> 08:19.263
The landlord photoshopped the surroundings out...

130
08:19.333 --> 08:22.133
and posted it online, and that runaway rookie...

131
08:22.193 --> 08:23.763
booked it without even visiting.

132
08:24.933 --> 08:26.633
Oh, my.

133
08:26.673 --> 08:29.773
The shoot is coming up soon. I thought I was going to get fired,

134
08:29.843 --> 08:31.743
but then your place came to mind.

135
08:31.773 --> 08:34.773
- So you want to shoot in my room? - No.

136
08:34.843 --> 08:37.213
The room is a set, just the rooftop.

137
08:39.653 --> 08:41.783
What did the landlord say? Is it okay?

138
08:43.053 --> 08:45.423
They said it is fine as long as you agree.

139
08:45.523 --> 08:48.123
They even offered to split the location fee half and half.

140
08:49.223 --> 08:50.263
Then...

141
08:50.893 --> 08:54.233
- do I get paid too? - Of course you do.

142
08:54.593 --> 08:57.363
Even if we only shoot exterior, it will be completely chaotic.

143
08:58.863 --> 09:00.803
- Then it is a deal. - Deal!

144
09:01.573 --> 09:05.003
- Right. Ryu Min is in your drama? - Yes.

145
09:05.503 --> 09:07.873
Su Kyung will be thrilled.

146
09:07.943 --> 09:10.043
She is going to annoy me so much.

147
09:11.113 --> 09:13.283
Hey, are you not going to your part-time job today?

148
09:14.453 --> 09:17.583
I am. I will go to the library and then work at night.

149
09:17.653 --> 09:19.223
You study at the library?

150
09:19.393 --> 09:21.623
Why? What about the study cafe?

151
09:24.593 --> 09:26.263
Are you avoiding it because you went with that jerk?

152
09:26.293 --> 09:27.933
Because it breaks your heart?

153
09:29.403 --> 09:32.163
No, it does not. I am going because it is free.

154
09:33.373 --> 09:36.703
They said they would open the library to graduates too,

155
09:36.773 --> 09:38.173
so I should take advantage of it.

156
09:38.243 --> 09:41.443
And above all, going there makes me feel like I belong somewhere,

157
09:41.513 --> 09:43.413
so it puts my mind at ease.

158
09:45.443 --> 09:47.683
Has that jerk Yong Seok contacted you?

159
09:52.723 --> 09:54.723
The more I think about it, the angrier I get.

160
09:54.793 --> 09:57.163
Hey. This fresh freshman...

161
09:57.223 --> 09:58.993
met a pathetic returning student,

162
09:59.063 --> 10:00.663
was a campus couple all through college,

163
10:00.733 --> 10:03.203
packed his lunches, wrote his reports,

164
10:03.263 --> 10:05.163
and saved him a seat during every exam period.

165
10:05.233 --> 10:08.203
And then, as soon as he gets a job, "I have feelings for my coworker."

166
10:08.233 --> 10:10.073
He just sends a text and ghosts you?

167
10:11.803 --> 10:13.513
They say there are a lot of people like that.

168
10:13.573 --> 10:15.042
People who fall in love at an orientation...

169
10:15.043 --> 10:16.943
- for new employees. - Exactly.

170
10:17.013 --> 10:18.483
Hey, you should go to an orientation too.

171
10:19.653 --> 10:20.883
How did your interview go yesterday?

172
10:23.283 --> 10:26.053
I have a good feeling about it this time.

173
10:26.123 --> 10:27.923
That is great.

174
10:27.993 --> 10:30.263
Then are you coming when we meet the others tomorrow?

175
10:32.793 --> 10:36.663
- I do not know. - Hey, we have to celebrate.

176
10:36.733 --> 10:39.003
If you do not show up at a time like this,

177
10:39.063 --> 10:40.503
they will think you are jealous.

178
10:42.943 --> 10:45.343
Well, I am a little jealous,

179
10:45.403 --> 10:47.943
but, honestly, if I go, I am worried Su Kyung...

180
10:48.013 --> 10:50.213
will not be able to celebrate fully.

181
10:52.413 --> 10:53.913
Silly girl.

182
10:53.983 --> 10:55.653
How can someone be so nice?

183
10:58.553 --> 10:59.893
Hey.

184
11:00.193 --> 11:02.723
Eat a fresh one. Here.

185
11:14.773 --> 11:15.773
What is it?

186
11:17.273 --> 11:20.243
- Who is it? - Why invite us and fall asleep?

187
11:23.583 --> 11:25.613
- Who did? - Who do you think?

188
11:27.013 --> 11:31.153
Da Hong lied. I knew something was weird.

189
11:31.253 --> 11:35.153
Now that you know, please leave. I am tired.

190
11:35.223 --> 11:37.563
Because the press conference atmosphere was bad yesterday,

191
11:37.623 --> 11:40.033
the director and all the staff had a team dinner,

192
11:40.093 --> 11:42.863
and he stayed until the very end, so he barely slept.

193
11:44.063 --> 11:46.233
He should have made an excuse and left early.

194
11:46.303 --> 11:48.403
Is Mu I the type of person to do that?

195
11:48.503 --> 11:50.543
Do you know what Mu I said yesterday?

196
11:50.603 --> 11:51.943
"The staff worked so hard."

197
11:52.003 --> 11:53.343
"I do not know when I will see them again."

198
11:53.413 --> 11:56.443
"Where would I go? My grandmother told me..."

199
11:56.513 --> 11:57.513
"that no matter how good the set is,"

200
11:57.583 --> 11:59.553
"and even if it seems like I will see those people again soon,"

201
11:59.613 --> 12:00.883
"I will not."

202
12:00.953 --> 12:03.083
"She said to treat them well, as if every day is the last.'"

203
12:03.153 --> 12:04.583
"Two more over here."

204
12:06.453 --> 12:07.823
He is the only nice one.

205
12:09.123 --> 12:10.963
So is he going straight into filming?

206
12:11.023 --> 12:12.023
Without taking a break?

207
12:12.093 --> 12:14.333
The company is telling him to do that.

208
12:14.393 --> 12:16.933
But Da Hong said she would not do it unless it was with Mu I,

209
12:17.003 --> 12:19.103
so CEO Ju came all the way to the set...

210
12:19.163 --> 12:21.833
and begged him. Being soft-hearted is a disease.

211
12:23.173 --> 12:27.413
- Doctor, is this a disease too? - Yes, a serious one.

212
12:28.743 --> 12:30.043
Then I should cure it.

213
12:31.343 --> 12:33.753
Jae Gyu, when Da Hong arrives, go hang out somewhere else.

214
12:33.813 --> 12:35.113
I am really tired.

215
12:36.283 --> 12:39.453
Da Hong suggested we meet here, so why is she not here?

216
12:41.953 --> 12:43.763
You are getting prettier and prettier.

217
12:44.893 --> 12:47.233
Right, just like that.

218
12:47.293 --> 12:49.503
Oh, my. Da Hong, you're here.

219
12:49.703 --> 12:50.733
What is this?

220
12:53.403 --> 12:55.703
She did not have a reservation,

221
12:55.773 --> 12:58.143
but she was in a hurry, so I took her first.

222
12:58.243 --> 12:59.273
Hello.

223
13:00.013 --> 13:01.043
Get out.

224
13:01.743 --> 13:03.082
- What? - You might not know...

225
13:03.083 --> 13:05.513
since you just changed salons to follow me,

226
13:06.083 --> 13:07.313
but this is my seat.

227
13:08.783 --> 13:11.453
Did you reserve it? Is your name written on it?

228
13:11.523 --> 13:13.153
The lighting here is the prettiest.

229
13:13.553 --> 13:16.023
Hurry up and get out, okay? Get out!

230
13:16.463 --> 13:17.563
Will you let go?

231
13:18.193 --> 13:20.763
Oh, my. I understand.

232
13:20.833 --> 13:22.263
Oh, dear.

233
13:22.663 --> 13:26.803
I am sorry, Min Ye. This is Da Hong's designated seat.

234
13:26.833 --> 13:28.903
It has been for a very long time.

235
13:29.373 --> 13:30.373
I am sorry.

236
13:32.473 --> 13:33.713
Oh, well...

237
13:34.273 --> 13:35.712
We are almost done, right?

238
13:35.713 --> 13:37.183
- Yes. - We still have the eyelashes...

239
13:37.243 --> 13:39.683
It is fine. My eyelashes are naturally long anyway.

240
13:43.853 --> 13:45.953
Oh, my. I am sorry.

241
13:48.923 --> 13:53.293
Oh, seriously. Why are you only like that to her?

242
13:53.393 --> 13:55.163
There is a reason for everything.

243
13:55.233 --> 13:57.233
Please make me look bright today.

244
13:57.303 --> 13:59.773
On a depressing day, at least my face should look bright.

245
13:59.803 --> 14:01.603
Who is so depressed?

246
14:01.703 --> 14:03.243
There is someone.

247
14:03.343 --> 14:04.743
Someone who is pretending to be fine,

248
14:04.803 --> 14:06.243
but is actually terrified.

249
14:07.313 --> 14:08.513
You are making me depressed.

250
14:12.213 --> 14:15.353
"Is Tak Mu I only a star for television dramas?"

251
14:16.483 --> 14:17.723
"Audiences who expected a romance line..."

252
14:17.783 --> 14:19.423
"will likely be completely disappointed."

253
14:21.653 --> 14:23.563
"The movie, 'I Didn't Know Back Then.'"

254
14:23.623 --> 14:26.363
"Tak Mu I looks like he is wearing clothes that do not fit."

255
14:26.433 --> 14:27.663
What are you doing?

256
14:27.733 --> 14:29.293
Are you a guy who reads malicious comments?

257
14:29.803 --> 14:31.403
Hey, the director said...

258
14:32.003 --> 14:34.133
he will edit it a bit before the release.

259
14:34.173 --> 14:35.333
Let's wait and see.

260
14:36.003 --> 14:37.873
Editing what's already shot won't change much.

261
14:39.943 --> 14:41.973
I really wasn't going to drink.

262
14:43.813 --> 14:46.013
Are you really going to do that project with Da Hong?

263
14:46.313 --> 14:49.153
She's headstrong, eccentric, and completely selfish.

264
14:49.283 --> 14:51.383
What kind of rom-com can you do with a kid like her?

265
14:52.023 --> 14:53.293
Will you even be able to get into character?

266
14:53.723 --> 14:54.752
Why?

267
14:54.753 --> 14:56.523
When Da Hong and Mu I were in elementary school,

268
14:56.593 --> 14:58.463
they already shot a rom-com together.

269
14:58.923 --> 14:59.933
They did.

270
15:00.493 --> 15:01.733
I saw it with my own eyes.

271
15:06.273 --> 15:09.433
Hey, Ju Da Hong's parents divorced because her mom cheated.

272
15:10.103 --> 15:11.543
My mom said...

273
15:11.573 --> 15:13.343
she could even go to prison for adultery.

274
15:14.543 --> 15:17.313
Min Ye, what's adultery?

275
15:17.783 --> 15:20.013
I don't know. I heard Da Hong's dad...

276
15:20.053 --> 15:22.013
is even getting a test to see if she's really his daughter.

277
15:23.453 --> 15:24.723
How do they do that?

278
15:26.793 --> 15:28.353
(Dressing Room A, Child Actors' Waiting Room)

279
15:30.723 --> 15:33.293
It's okay. Don't cry.

280
15:33.733 --> 15:34.763
Okay?

281
15:35.433 --> 15:37.603
Don't cry, Da Hong, it's okay.

282
15:38.063 --> 15:40.573
(Yoon Jae Gyu, Age 11)

283
15:43.573 --> 15:45.703
Da Hong has been like that ever since,

284
15:46.343 --> 15:49.173
saying Tak Mu I belongs to her and that she's going to marry him.

285
15:50.313 --> 15:51.913
I also didn't know Da Hong would stay...

286
15:51.983 --> 15:53.753
so devoted for this long.

287
15:54.783 --> 15:59.353
- Mu I, here comes your bride. - Here comes the bride.

288
15:59.423 --> 16:02.053
Hey, you can't just barge into someone else's house.

289
16:02.123 --> 16:03.793
That's the only way I get to see you guys.

290
16:03.863 --> 16:05.723
Otherwise, you'd just say you're tired and not come out.

291
16:08.663 --> 16:11.963
- Where's my drink? - Ju Da Hong.

292
16:12.033 --> 16:15.533
- Greet us first when you see us. - Oh, hi.

293
16:15.833 --> 16:18.043
What's this? Did you go to a salon?

294
16:18.973 --> 16:21.273
What are you talking about? I only put on some tone-up cream.

295
16:22.443 --> 16:25.012
Where's the beer? My dark beer.

296
16:25.013 --> 16:27.253
Oh, all right. I'll go get it, just wait.

297
16:27.313 --> 16:31.983
- Why should you go? I'll go. - Really?

298
16:32.053 --> 16:33.493
Hurry back.

299
16:41.363 --> 16:42.533
Welcome.

300
16:48.433 --> 16:51.703
Which one of these two is better?

301
16:51.843 --> 16:52.843
Condoms?

302
16:54.773 --> 16:56.343
I'm asking...

303
16:56.843 --> 16:59.543
which one is better between the two.

304
17:00.913 --> 17:01.913
Excuse me?

305
17:03.883 --> 17:07.193
You must not be able to answer because you've never used them.

306
17:08.523 --> 17:09.793
Then while we're at it,

307
17:10.893 --> 17:12.263
should we try them together?

308
17:13.863 --> 17:17.263
- What? - Oh, my, what's with that look?

309
17:18.863 --> 17:20.833
What are you thinking about right now?

310
17:21.603 --> 17:23.143
I'm just saying there are a lot in the box,

311
17:23.203 --> 17:25.373
so we should split them.

312
17:27.873 --> 17:29.783
- Excuse me. - What?

313
17:31.083 --> 17:32.083
Honey?

314
17:34.713 --> 17:37.553
Young women these days are so open-minded.

315
17:37.623 --> 17:39.223
You're making me blush.

316
17:43.393 --> 17:46.433
Sir, your eyesight must be failing you.

317
17:46.493 --> 17:49.733
It's all written right here. The left one is ultra-thin,

318
17:50.263 --> 17:53.873
which means it's very thin. And it's strawberry flavored.

319
17:54.373 --> 17:56.743
The right one contains benzocaine,

320
17:57.173 --> 17:58.743
a numbing agent.

321
17:58.803 --> 17:59.973
You know what that is, right?

322
18:00.443 --> 18:02.143
Hey, you little brat.

323
18:02.913 --> 18:04.213
Are you looking down on me?

324
18:06.113 --> 18:09.153
- Sir, when did I ever... - Just because I'm bad at English...

325
18:09.213 --> 18:13.393
and failed the promotion exam, are you looking down on me too?

326
18:14.023 --> 18:17.463
So what if a Korean is not good at English?

327
18:18.763 --> 18:23.303
I am good at Japanese. I am really good at it, okay?

328
18:23.363 --> 18:27.303
"How are you? Thank you for the food."

329
18:27.373 --> 18:28.373
How is that?

330
18:32.603 --> 18:36.313
Why can you not answer? So you are looking down on me?

331
18:36.373 --> 18:39.613
Hey, you are just a part-timer. Are you looking down on me too?

332
18:39.643 --> 18:41.683
You are looking down on me?

333
18:41.713 --> 18:42.983
You startled me!

334
18:43.053 --> 18:45.252
You startled me. What is it?

335
18:45.253 --> 18:48.953
I am sorry. I thought you were done. Please continue.

336
18:51.723 --> 18:52.823
Hey.

337
18:52.863 --> 18:54.463
Do you call that being good at Japanese?

338
18:55.763 --> 18:57.063
Crazy jerk.

339
18:57.363 --> 18:59.563
That is why you are a failure.

340
18:59.833 --> 19:02.033
Everyone probably knows you are a nuisance except you.

341
19:03.003 --> 19:04.843
Guys like you are the most pathetic.

342
19:05.443 --> 19:08.813
You get slapped somewhere else and cannot say a word about it,

343
19:09.273 --> 19:11.913
but you pick fights with people weaker than you.

344
19:12.383 --> 19:13.783
"Excuse me."

345
19:14.783 --> 19:17.723
Are you talking to me right now?

346
19:18.253 --> 19:19.853
No, my friend.

347
19:23.723 --> 19:28.663
- I will call you back later. Bye. - You crazy idiot.

348
19:28.693 --> 19:31.603
You punk! Do you know who I am?

349
19:32.933 --> 19:33.933
I do.

350
19:34.873 --> 19:38.973
A nuisance who is good at Japanese but bad at English.

351
19:39.643 --> 19:42.313
- You punk! - Punk?

352
19:42.713 --> 19:47.053
- Who are you calling a punk? - Hold on.

353
19:48.853 --> 19:50.883
You seem very drunk,

354
19:50.923 --> 19:52.723
and you must be under a lot of stress.

355
19:55.123 --> 19:57.663
I will give you this. It is on me.

356
20:00.993 --> 20:02.463
Drink it!

357
20:02.563 --> 20:03.563
Gosh.

358
20:07.803 --> 20:09.733
I drank it all.

359
20:13.513 --> 20:15.943
I will just take one of the ultra-thin ones.

360
20:16.013 --> 20:17.113
No.

361
20:17.813 --> 20:19.183
Keep the change.

362
20:39.333 --> 20:42.173
What? What is this? Did someone order this?

363
20:45.803 --> 20:47.473
Gosh, awesome.

364
20:47.543 --> 20:49.673
- Is it really good? - You are here?

365
20:49.743 --> 20:51.713
- You are here? - Did you order food?

366
20:51.783 --> 20:52.983
No.

367
20:53.383 --> 20:55.282
What? Who is it from?

368
20:55.283 --> 20:57.653
Who else? A fan must have left it.

369
21:00.853 --> 21:02.593
(Eat up and cheer up.)

370
21:02.653 --> 21:04.163
"Eat up and cheer up."

371
21:04.663 --> 21:06.293
See? It is a fan, right?

372
21:06.693 --> 21:08.693
Do not eat it. You do not know what is inside.

373
21:09.233 --> 21:10.233
Gosh.

374
21:10.633 --> 21:12.302
How did they know my address?

375
21:12.303 --> 21:13.433
Are they a neighbor?

376
21:19.303 --> 21:20.473
Da Hong.

377
21:20.943 --> 21:23.743
What if someone made dirty jokes about you?

378
21:24.313 --> 21:27.183
- How would you feel? - Gosh, why would I let that slide?

379
21:27.213 --> 21:28.453
I would humiliate them.

380
21:29.753 --> 21:30.753
Why?

381
21:31.253 --> 21:32.353
Nothing.

382
21:33.023 --> 21:35.523
Oh, right, I heard Ryu Min is going to be in your drama too.

383
21:36.153 --> 21:37.393
He is already doing so well as a singer.

384
21:37.463 --> 21:39.123
Why does he suddenly want to act?

385
21:39.863 --> 21:41.893
I worked really hard to persuade him.

386
21:47.573 --> 21:49.503
- Let's go! - Okay.

387
21:57.113 --> 22:00.083
One, two, three, four.

388
22:00.153 --> 22:04.483
One, two, three, four, five, six, seven, eight.

389
22:04.553 --> 22:09.393
One, two, three, four, five, six, seven, eight.

390
22:09.453 --> 22:14.193
One, two, three, four, five, six, seven, eight.

391
22:14.263 --> 22:19.203
One, two, three, four, five, six, seven, eight.

392
22:23.843 --> 22:26.543
Five, six, seven, eight.

393
22:26.603 --> 22:30.113
One, two, three, four, five, six.

394
22:37.553 --> 22:39.153
"Be your name."

395
22:45.293 --> 22:46.863
- All right, let's take a break. - Okay.

396
22:46.933 --> 22:47.933
- Great job, everyone. - Good work.

397
22:47.993 --> 22:49.393
- Great job. - Great job.

398
22:49.463 --> 22:50.603
Let's go take a break.

399
23:02.173 --> 23:03.273
I saw the articles.

400
23:04.013 --> 23:05.613
Should I call you an actor now?

401
23:07.483 --> 23:10.183
Why are you being like this? It is not like that.

402
23:10.583 --> 23:11.723
Do your best.

403
23:15.223 --> 23:16.963
("Rooftop Romance")

404
23:21.093 --> 23:22.333
(You have a new message.)

405
23:27.173 --> 23:30.803
(Thank you for applying to Everybody Dairy.)

406
23:30.873 --> 23:35.473
(We regret to inform you that we cannot offer you a position.)

407
23:46.183 --> 23:48.923
- Boarding. - If they just told me like that,

408
23:48.993 --> 23:50.263
- wouldn't it be so nice? - Transfer.

409
23:51.693 --> 23:53.423
- Insufficient balance. - What?

410
23:53.833 --> 23:54.863
Darn it.

411
23:55.293 --> 23:57.903
- Insufficient balance. - "Insufficient memory."

412
24:01.133 --> 24:02.803
"Insufficient sleep."

413
24:03.233 --> 24:05.602
- Please hurry up. - I am sorry.

414
24:05.603 --> 24:07.773
- "Insufficient patience." - Where is it?

415
24:11.113 --> 24:12.283
What exactly...

416
24:13.283 --> 24:14.613
am I lacking?

417
24:18.053 --> 24:19.623
Sir, please wait a second!

418
24:22.493 --> 24:23.663
Thank you.

419
24:26.093 --> 24:28.293
"Insufficient common sense."

420
24:29.893 --> 24:31.563
(Research Corner)

421
24:45.843 --> 24:48.713
("Successful Cover Letters")

422
25:02.793 --> 25:04.233
You are coming today, right?

423
25:04.463 --> 25:07.133
Even if you have to go to your part-time job, stop by for a bit.

424
25:07.203 --> 25:08.973
(Yeon Ju)

425
25:09.373 --> 25:10.403
- Cheers! - Cheers!

426
25:10.473 --> 25:12.543
Bottoms up, or you are paying.

427
25:21.853 --> 25:23.553
I should have ordered an Earl Grey too.

428
25:23.583 --> 25:24.853
This is too sour.

429
25:24.883 --> 25:26.783
Hey, I told you not to use that word.

430
25:28.523 --> 25:30.793
- Sorry. - "Sour."

431
25:30.863 --> 25:33.423
Gosh, I need to be a designer so people will call me a pro.

432
25:33.493 --> 25:35.663
I am so sick to death of being called an assistant.

433
25:36.033 --> 25:38.703
Hey, do you guys have any idea how much hair splinters hurt?

434
25:38.763 --> 25:41.173
When I go home, they are under my nails, in my clothes,

435
25:41.233 --> 25:42.573
and in my ears.

436
25:42.603 --> 25:44.373
They get stuck everywhere and poke me,

437
25:44.443 --> 25:46.073
and no matter how many I pull out, there are always more.

438
25:46.143 --> 25:48.142
Look, they keep coming out like zombies.

439
25:48.143 --> 25:52.343
- Our assistant goes through a lot. - Hey!

440
25:53.783 --> 25:54.783
Excuse me.

441
25:54.853 --> 25:57.853
- Four more Earl Greys, please. - Okay.

442
25:58.153 --> 25:59.783
It is driving me crazy too.

443
25:59.923 --> 26:03.353
I finally got a junior after five years as a producer,

444
26:03.423 --> 26:07.563
and I was done being the youngest, but they quit after one month.

445
26:07.593 --> 26:09.263
- After I taught them everything. - What?

446
26:10.663 --> 26:12.133
Everyone is having a hard time.

447
26:12.863 --> 26:13.933
Lim Su Kyung.

448
26:14.003 --> 26:17.043
In the midst of all this, congrats on joining a big company.

449
26:17.103 --> 26:20.173
Thank you. Good things come to those who wait.

450
26:21.543 --> 26:23.813
I thought everything would be great once I joined,

451
26:23.883 --> 26:26.283
but I am so stressed out because of my peers.

452
26:26.313 --> 26:28.953
- Why? - Is it because I am older?

453
26:29.013 --> 26:30.013
They only hang out among themselves.

454
26:30.083 --> 26:31.523
I think they even have a separate group chat.

455
26:32.453 --> 26:35.093
- Is it really because of your age? - Hey.

456
26:36.653 --> 26:37.793
I heard you had an interview?

457
26:39.323 --> 26:41.333
Yes, I failed.

458
26:44.833 --> 26:46.333
- See? - Gosh.

459
26:46.403 --> 26:48.073
With that jerk Yong Seok and everything,

460
26:48.133 --> 26:49.803
why is nothing working out for you lately?

461
26:51.503 --> 26:54.073
You know, about your job hunt...

462
26:54.573 --> 26:57.083
When we park, there are spots if we go further down,

463
26:57.143 --> 26:59.483
but we circle because we do not want to go all the way down.

464
26:59.513 --> 27:02.813
Stop beating around the bush. What are you trying to say?

465
27:02.883 --> 27:04.783
I was thinking you should lower your standards a bit.

466
27:04.853 --> 27:06.783
- We are getting older too. - Hey.

467
27:06.853 --> 27:08.153
Yes, that was a bit harsh.

468
27:08.223 --> 27:09.722
Do you think she'd get that comparison...

469
27:09.723 --> 27:11.423
- when she doesn't have a car? - What?

470
27:11.763 --> 27:15.693
What? I am just upset for her.

471
27:15.763 --> 27:18.732
I thought she'd make a living just by writing.

472
27:18.733 --> 27:19.963
When I was in second grade,

473
27:20.033 --> 27:21.133
I really do not remember anything else,

474
27:21.203 --> 27:24.473
- but I remember her poem. - Yes, that one.

475
27:24.543 --> 27:28.373
- Titled "Spring Flowers." - Gosh, you have a good memory.

476
27:28.873 --> 27:31.713
Even the teachers said a genius had appeared.

477
27:31.783 --> 27:34.813
That poem was put up outside the staff room until we graduated.

478
27:34.883 --> 27:37.123
Gosh, stop. That is all in the past.

479
27:37.183 --> 27:40.453
That's not all. She swept every writing contest there was.

480
27:40.523 --> 27:41.993
Whenever she wrote a story, we would wait...

481
27:42.053 --> 27:43.093
to take turns reading it.

482
27:43.153 --> 27:44.563
Everyone said like father, like daughter...

483
27:44.623 --> 27:48.063
How crazy! That is right. I went to the bookstore a while ago.

484
27:48.093 --> 27:52.133
Her father's new novel, is already a bestseller.

485
27:52.203 --> 27:53.733
I think he is so amazing.

486
27:53.803 --> 27:55.633
There must be some genetics involved in writing, for sure.

487
27:55.673 --> 27:58.303
Hey. I should get going.

488
27:58.373 --> 28:00.773
What? After only one drink?

489
28:00.843 --> 28:04.013
It is time for my part-time job. I will pay for what we had so far.

490
28:04.083 --> 28:05.883
What are you talking about? I will pay.

491
28:05.943 --> 28:08.283
No, you can treat me when you get your paycheck.

492
28:09.513 --> 28:11.023
- I am leaving. - Bye.

493
28:11.083 --> 28:13.623
Excuse me, I would like to pay.

494
28:14.323 --> 28:15.923
Hurry up and go.

495
28:15.993 --> 28:17.893
Here are your four Earl Greys.

496
28:17.963 --> 28:18.963
Thank you.

497
28:23.463 --> 28:24.533
Hey.

498
28:25.263 --> 28:26.633
- What? - What? What is it?

499
28:26.703 --> 28:29.203
Gosh, you selfish jerks.

500
28:29.273 --> 28:31.543
- What did we do? - What?

501
28:32.143 --> 28:34.243
What about the parking lot?

502
28:34.313 --> 28:37.612
What are you saying to someone who has nowhere lower to go?

503
28:37.613 --> 28:39.913
Hey, Yu Il...

504
28:39.983 --> 28:42.053
has better grades than you, Su Kyung,

505
28:42.113 --> 28:45.653
and a better educational background. And she is prettier too.

506
28:45.723 --> 28:48.753
Why tell her to lower standards when you will not lower yours?

507
28:48.823 --> 28:52.823
- Well, that's because... - And who wrote your cover letters?

508
28:53.323 --> 28:55.863
Who wrote your love letters?

509
28:55.933 --> 28:58.233
You guys really are ungrateful.

510
28:58.633 --> 29:00.533
I told you not to talk about her dad.

511
29:00.573 --> 29:03.303
- Why do you keep bringing it up? - So why is she acting like this?

512
29:03.373 --> 29:05.243
You will not tell us anything, so we keep...

513
29:05.303 --> 29:10.373
I mean, just do not do it. She said she hates it, okay?

514
29:10.443 --> 29:12.683
Why do you keep bringing up things she hates?

515
29:12.713 --> 29:14.452
That is why you get called an assistant,

516
29:14.453 --> 29:16.212
and you are always left out.

517
29:16.213 --> 29:17.683
- Hey! - What?

518
29:19.423 --> 29:20.993
Instead of wasting time drinking with you guys,

519
29:21.053 --> 29:23.023
I am just going to get some sleep.

520
29:23.093 --> 29:24.993
- Why, you little... - Seriously.

521
29:25.163 --> 29:26.163
Assistant.

522
29:51.953 --> 29:53.483
(The End)

523
29:54.423 --> 29:55.793
Done!

524
29:56.453 --> 29:57.893
Dad, I finished writing it.

525
29:59.593 --> 30:00.593
Right.

526
30:06.003 --> 30:07.733
You did a great job.

527
30:07.873 --> 30:10.803
Publishers will go crazy wanting to make this a children's book too.

528
30:10.873 --> 30:12.273
No, let us just keep it to ourselves.

529
30:14.413 --> 30:15.543
Okay.

530
30:15.613 --> 30:17.243
Well, if the author says so, we have to.

531
30:18.443 --> 30:20.553
Dad, what kind of drawing would look good here?

532
30:24.353 --> 30:26.583
- A bear? - Yes.

533
30:30.823 --> 30:32.263
You need some sugar. Eat this while you write.

534
30:34.633 --> 30:36.593
Someone went abroad again?

535
30:36.663 --> 30:37.833
Yes, a junior colleague.

536
30:38.433 --> 30:40.203
They asked if I needed anything,

537
30:40.233 --> 30:41.433
so I just told them to bring back some candy.

538
30:42.873 --> 30:45.173
I do not know why they do not sell this candy here.

539
30:46.443 --> 30:48.343
Is your work going well?

540
30:48.413 --> 30:50.643
Yes, I am right at the deadline.

541
30:50.713 --> 30:53.913
Goodness, you are going to be more famous than me.

542
30:53.983 --> 30:56.912
Well, you had better step it up, Dad.

543
30:56.913 --> 30:57.923
I will.

544
30:58.783 --> 30:59.783
Where is your mom?

545
31:00.993 --> 31:02.593
Mom?

546
31:02.653 --> 31:05.023
She is sleeping. She said she has a headache.

547
31:07.233 --> 31:08.233
Is that so?

548
31:09.533 --> 31:11.063
Dad.

549
31:11.133 --> 31:12.563
Mom keeps crying.

550
31:13.503 --> 31:14.503
Did you two fight?

551
31:16.403 --> 31:17.403
Of course not.

552
31:19.403 --> 31:20.913
("Byeol I and Moon Bear" Volume 2)

553
31:21.013 --> 31:22.073
I enjoyed reading it.

554
31:22.573 --> 31:24.413
You wrote it even better than Volume One.

555
31:24.483 --> 31:25.843
The ending is great too.

556
31:25.913 --> 31:26.913
Really?

557
31:26.983 --> 31:28.083
(Private Counseling Room)

558
31:28.213 --> 31:31.183
I think your writing...

559
31:31.253 --> 31:32.983
is really good.

560
31:34.753 --> 31:36.323
Well, I do not have anything else to give you.

561
31:38.963 --> 31:39.963
Have this.

562
31:40.933 --> 31:41.963
Wait.

563
31:43.433 --> 31:45.363
I actually brought some to give to you too.

564
31:47.873 --> 31:49.873
Oh, you did.

565
31:50.303 --> 31:51.943
But they do not really sell these in Korea.

566
31:52.403 --> 31:53.403
How fascinating.

567
31:54.543 --> 31:55.543
I know, right?

568
32:03.153 --> 32:04.153
Mom.

569
32:05.853 --> 32:08.693
Mom, what is wrong? Why are you crying?

570
32:08.753 --> 32:09.753
What is all this?

571
32:11.123 --> 32:12.623
- What is this? - Your dad...

572
32:13.523 --> 32:16.033
Your dad says he wants to live with this woman.

573
32:17.533 --> 32:18.533
Woman?

574
32:29.613 --> 32:31.743
Oh, that cannot be true.

575
32:32.943 --> 32:34.553
He is not that kind of person.

576
32:52.303 --> 32:54.473
(Hometown Diner)

577
33:08.253 --> 33:09.983
Where is your mind wandering off to?

578
33:11.083 --> 33:12.083
Hello?

579
33:13.123 --> 33:16.893
Oh, I am just feeling sleepy,

580
33:16.953 --> 33:18.863
and bad thoughts keep coming to mind.

581
33:20.123 --> 33:21.833
The thing about thoughts is,

582
33:21.893 --> 33:24.833
the good ones all run away somewhere,

583
33:24.933 --> 33:28.403
and the bad ones keep crawling in and rattling you.

584
33:29.833 --> 33:31.743
Does that happen to you too?

585
33:32.073 --> 33:34.003
Do you know what the good thing about getting old is?

586
33:34.373 --> 33:37.243
There were definitely more bad times,

587
33:37.313 --> 33:40.083
but miraculously, I only remember the good ones.

588
33:41.783 --> 33:46.623
My awful husband, my burdensome children,

589
33:46.653 --> 33:49.453
and my resentful parents are all gone,

590
33:49.893 --> 33:52.323
and everything is like a blooming April.

591
33:52.863 --> 33:56.933
All the freezing and sweating is completely forgotten.

592
33:58.933 --> 33:59.933
Really?

593
34:00.703 --> 34:03.273
Does that make you want to grow old quickly?

594
34:04.473 --> 34:05.743
Hurry up and eat.

595
34:05.773 --> 34:07.913
- Yes, thank you for the food. - Okay.

596
34:32.033 --> 34:33.033
You startled me.

597
34:36.073 --> 34:40.473
Hey, what are you doing here? And what is all this?

598
34:41.943 --> 34:45.942
Ta-da. Our Ryu Min merchandise.

599
34:45.943 --> 34:48.013
I heard the news from Yeon Ju.

600
34:48.053 --> 34:51.123
If we display all of this in your room,

601
34:51.183 --> 34:53.183
Ryu Min will see it while filming.

602
34:53.853 --> 34:55.623
Imagine how encouraged he will feel.

603
34:56.693 --> 34:58.363
Did you come all the way here just for this?

604
34:58.423 --> 34:59.463
What about your work?

605
35:00.623 --> 35:01.763
Today is Sunday.

606
35:03.393 --> 35:04.403
Right.

607
35:08.133 --> 35:10.173
Yu Il, I am sorry about yesterday.

608
35:12.503 --> 35:15.513
I really only left because it was time for my shift.

609
35:15.543 --> 35:19.543
Right? I knew it. Yeon Ju was just overreacting.

610
35:22.983 --> 35:25.922
Well, this rooftop has a similar vibe to the original story.

611
35:25.923 --> 35:27.593
The wooden bench is nice, we can take down the clothesline,

612
35:27.653 --> 35:28.953
hang some lights here,

613
35:29.023 --> 35:30.963
and just move those things to the back, right?

614
35:35.763 --> 35:38.433
"When does the filming end?"

615
35:38.503 --> 35:39.703
"Take some pictures and send them to me."

616
35:39.763 --> 35:42.573
"If our Ryu Min needs to go, open up your bathroom for him."

617
35:42.633 --> 35:43.703
"Make sure you clean it."

618
35:43.773 --> 35:45.843
Su Kyung has been making a fuss since this morning.

619
35:45.903 --> 35:49.413
- You should not have told her. - I am regretting it now.

620
35:51.183 --> 35:52.683
- Hey, by the way, - Yes.

621
35:52.743 --> 35:54.583
seeing Ryu Min in person,

622
35:54.683 --> 35:58.353
- he really is handsome. - Yes, but do not tell her that.

623
35:58.423 --> 36:00.823
She gets upset because he does not look as good on screen.

624
36:00.853 --> 36:03.193
Then what should I say? That he looks better on television?

625
36:03.253 --> 36:06.023
No. Do not say anything at all.

626
36:06.093 --> 36:08.163
Just look at him.

627
36:08.833 --> 36:09.863
Who are you?

628
36:11.833 --> 36:12.863
Are you her friend?

629
36:14.003 --> 36:15.673
- Hello. - Oh, hello.

630
36:15.733 --> 36:16.933
- Hello. - Hello.

631
36:18.303 --> 36:19.343
What? Con...

632
36:21.143 --> 36:22.143
Con?

633
36:26.013 --> 36:27.383
I want to eat corn cheese.

634
36:30.153 --> 36:31.183
Do you like corn cheese?

635
36:32.853 --> 36:34.993
Oh, yes, I guess.

636
36:35.493 --> 36:36.523
You like it?

637
36:38.393 --> 36:39.423
Well, then.

638
36:42.263 --> 36:43.833
Why is the convenience store worker here?

639
36:45.103 --> 36:46.363
Is she a staff member?

640
36:46.803 --> 36:49.833
He did not have that kind of image when I saw him on television.

641
36:50.233 --> 36:51.973
He is not usually like that.

642
36:52.543 --> 36:53.843
Does he like corn cheese?

643
36:55.513 --> 36:56.913
- See you. - Okay.

644
36:59.213 --> 37:01.913
I am usually the first one, but I lost my spot today.

645
37:02.013 --> 37:04.723
- I was worried. - Oh, there is no need to worry.

646
37:04.783 --> 37:06.183
You did perfectly fine at the reading.

647
37:08.093 --> 37:09.953
But Mu I, do you want to eat corn cheese?

648
37:12.063 --> 37:14.123
Oh, no, it is fattening.

649
37:15.163 --> 37:17.333
(Central Library)

650
37:19.863 --> 37:21.433
(Gender: Female)

651
37:21.503 --> 37:22.773
(Save changes)

652
37:22.833 --> 37:25.573
(228 dollars)

653
37:26.503 --> 37:28.743
Why is the application fee 228 dollars?

654
37:29.943 --> 37:32.143
They are bleeding me dry.

655
37:35.683 --> 37:38.183
Filming is done. Restoration is done.

656
37:38.253 --> 37:39.523
(Yeon Ju)

657
37:39.623 --> 37:40.623
Okay.

658
37:41.623 --> 37:42.823
(Okay.)

659
37:44.193 --> 37:45.193
Gosh.

660
37:56.633 --> 37:57.673
What is this?

661
38:00.173 --> 38:01.913
What is it?

662
38:04.513 --> 38:07.443
"I can hear everything even if you do not speak so loudly."

663
38:07.483 --> 38:08.713
What is this?

664
38:11.183 --> 38:12.353
(I can hear everything even if you do not speak so loudly.)

665
38:15.223 --> 38:16.323
It's still warm.

666
38:19.123 --> 38:20.123
What is it?

667
38:21.863 --> 38:23.293
It's hot! Oh, gosh.

668
38:23.363 --> 38:24.363
Goodness.

669
38:35.513 --> 38:37.743
Hey, look at this.

670
38:38.083 --> 38:40.183
They know exactly where the cameras are.

671
38:40.483 --> 38:42.613
Let us report this. We have to.

672
38:42.713 --> 38:44.753
Oh, they will not catch them even if we report it.

673
38:44.783 --> 38:46.483
We do not even know if it is a man or a woman.

674
38:46.923 --> 38:48.823
And they did not even enter the house.

675
38:49.193 --> 38:51.693
Who would do anything for something like this?

676
38:52.023 --> 38:53.823
It will just be annoying going back and forth.

677
38:53.863 --> 38:56.093
The corn cheese was warm earlier.

678
38:56.693 --> 38:57.863
Is that not really creepy?

679
38:57.933 --> 39:00.203
It means they knew when you would arrive.

680
39:00.303 --> 39:01.373
Wait!

681
39:02.133 --> 39:04.803
You do not think they put drugs in the food, do you?

682
39:06.903 --> 39:08.073
They might have.

683
39:09.443 --> 39:10.873
Could it be someone around you?

684
39:11.413 --> 39:13.043
To just call them a fan,

685
39:13.113 --> 39:14.713
they know your house and your schedule.

686
39:16.653 --> 39:17.823
Someone around me?

687
39:19.783 --> 39:21.093
Oh, it is probably a fan.

688
39:27.363 --> 39:28.963
("Byeol I and Moon Bear" Volume 2)

689
39:29.963 --> 39:32.103
You brought out the Buddhist scriptures again.

690
39:33.863 --> 39:36.973
Oh, I mean my mom, Mrs. Chu,

691
39:37.033 --> 39:39.143
recites Buddhist scriptures when she is anxious.

692
39:42.373 --> 39:44.943
I just want to get some sleep, forget about the movie.

693
39:47.513 --> 39:49.683
About this book, though.

694
39:49.753 --> 39:52.753
When is Volume Three coming out anyway? Seriously.

695
39:52.823 --> 39:53.823
This is really something.

696
39:55.053 --> 39:57.053
Tell me about it.

697
39:57.123 --> 39:58.563
How many years has it been already?

698
40:01.093 --> 40:02.463
Did the author die?

699
40:02.533 --> 40:04.332
- Yeong Su! - Gosh.

700
40:04.333 --> 40:06.333
- What? - Oh, seriously.

701
40:08.703 --> 40:10.133
Oh, sorry, I almost cursed.

702
40:11.073 --> 40:12.303
You basically did.

703
40:12.373 --> 40:14.913
Look at your eyes. They are cursing me out.

704
40:17.943 --> 40:19.743
Oh, my, I can see him really well.

705
40:19.813 --> 40:21.553
- He is coming out. - He is handsome.

706
40:25.283 --> 40:27.323
Is Ryu Min not here yet?

707
40:31.863 --> 40:32.863
The convenience store worker?

708
40:33.893 --> 40:35.163
So she is not a staff member.

709
40:36.493 --> 40:37.633
Did she come to watch?

710
40:38.103 --> 40:40.633
No way. I think I just made eye contact with Tak Mu I.

711
40:40.703 --> 40:42.533
Are you crazy? It was me.

712
40:42.603 --> 40:43.703
He is so handsome, seriously.

713
40:45.143 --> 40:46.543
Hey, girls,

714
40:46.603 --> 40:50.273
we are just faces in the crowd to him.

715
40:58.353 --> 41:01.493
Excuse me. You cannot take pictures.

716
41:09.933 --> 41:11.093
I was not taking a picture...

717
41:11.163 --> 41:14.833
The corn cheese story that only the people on set heard...

718
41:15.073 --> 41:16.073
I did not take any.

719
41:18.403 --> 41:19.873
And the black hoodie...

720
41:23.173 --> 41:25.643
Condoms to corn cheese?

721
41:26.643 --> 41:28.283
All right, let's run the rehearsal.

722
41:28.353 --> 41:29.583
Let's run the rehearsal!

723
41:30.613 --> 41:33.223
- This is how they actually film it. - Please step aside.

724
41:35.023 --> 41:36.923
Check it first.

725
41:36.993 --> 41:38.793
- Check it first. - Yes, sir.

726
41:40.863 --> 41:43.463
Hello. Yes, where are you right now?

727
41:46.503 --> 41:47.733
This is bad.

728
41:49.203 --> 41:51.973
I keep seeing handsome celebrities lately,

729
41:53.003 --> 41:55.273
so all the customers look...

730
42:14.293 --> 42:15.293
Are you going to ring me up?

731
42:19.303 --> 42:21.033
I said, are you going to ring me up?

732
42:22.103 --> 42:23.633
Oh, yes, I am sorry.

733
42:25.643 --> 42:27.843
(Roasted Squid)

734
42:33.913 --> 42:34.913
What?

735
42:35.913 --> 42:38.183
Well, he seems to have a good personality.

736
42:40.253 --> 42:42.123
I guess he likes corn cheese.

737
42:42.193 --> 42:44.663
Oh, my, that is quite modest for a top star.

738
42:47.123 --> 42:49.732
Honey, do you want to come home for dinner today?

739
42:49.733 --> 42:51.403
I made a lot of delicious food.

740
42:53.003 --> 42:54.333
What did you make?

741
42:54.403 --> 42:56.503
Your dad's favorite meat dish.

742
42:56.833 --> 42:58.643
Soup, fried food.

743
42:59.673 --> 43:02.413
Honey, have you ever heard of blowfish bulgogi?

744
43:02.473 --> 43:04.913
I learned a new recipe and tried making it.

745
43:05.243 --> 43:06.613
Is he coming?

746
43:06.683 --> 43:08.113
He said he'd come weeks ago and didn't show up,

747
43:08.183 --> 43:10.413
so you had a hard time finishing all the leftovers.

748
43:10.953 --> 43:12.083
Oh, he said he is coming.

749
43:12.153 --> 43:14.153
He said he is definitely coming today.

750
43:14.483 --> 43:16.123
Oh, and you believe that?

751
43:16.153 --> 43:17.323
Do you really believe him?

752
43:19.723 --> 43:21.023
Look, he is here.

753
43:21.093 --> 43:22.433
I told you he was definitely coming today.

754
43:22.463 --> 43:23.493
I have to go.

755
43:28.703 --> 43:29.773
Hello?

756
43:30.373 --> 43:31.403
Hello?

757
43:34.373 --> 43:35.643
Oh, welcome.

758
43:39.983 --> 43:41.013
What?

759
43:43.553 --> 43:45.453
Should I test the waters?

760
43:45.523 --> 43:47.023
Excuse me.

761
43:47.083 --> 43:49.953
I was actually wondering when you would come by.

762
43:50.523 --> 43:51.893
What? Did she recognize me?

763
43:56.993 --> 43:58.063
Retreat for now.

764
44:09.743 --> 44:10.743
(Roasted Eggs)

765
44:14.613 --> 44:16.053
That will be 1.8 dollars.

766
44:17.413 --> 44:20.753
The delivery truck will come by again later around 4pm.

767
44:20.823 --> 44:23.593
You can buy a salad lunchbox if you come back then.

768
44:24.623 --> 44:25.623
Okay.

769
44:27.063 --> 44:29.763
I just noticed you buy them often.

770
44:30.333 --> 44:31.433
And...

771
44:32.703 --> 44:35.803
thank you for last time.

772
44:36.073 --> 44:37.873
I realized I never got to say that.

773
44:46.213 --> 44:48.713
Oh, do you need anything else...

774
44:50.153 --> 44:51.213
Oh, no.

775
44:53.453 --> 44:55.293
What is his deal? Making me feel awkward.

776
44:59.893 --> 45:01.393
What? Did she not recognize me?

777
45:03.733 --> 45:04.763
No.

778
45:05.863 --> 45:07.563
She definitely recognized me as the condom guy.

779
45:25.353 --> 45:29.023
(Chaewoon Salad, I set it aside before it ran out.)

780
45:33.693 --> 45:34.933
Welcome.

781
45:40.163 --> 45:41.603
Are you looking for anything in particular?

782
45:41.673 --> 45:45.443
Oh, the woman who was working here just a moment ago...

783
45:45.473 --> 45:47.473
Oh, she just got off work.

784
45:48.003 --> 45:49.013
Excuse me?

785
45:55.813 --> 45:59.483
- Your dad says he misses you. - Forget it. I do not want to hear.

786
46:00.523 --> 46:02.053
Your dad...

787
46:02.153 --> 46:03.623
asked his publishing company...

788
46:03.693 --> 46:07.393
Mom, I am never accepting his help.

789
46:07.423 --> 46:10.233
- Whatever it is, I will do it. - Your dad is worried about you.

790
46:11.903 --> 46:14.063
I heard you failed your interview this time too.

791
46:14.103 --> 46:16.603
Mom, it is too late. I am hanging up.

792
46:21.043 --> 46:22.743
I have to take the TOEFL.

793
46:23.343 --> 46:25.183
I have to rewrite my cover letter too.

794
46:27.113 --> 46:29.283
Should I just quit everything and get a certification?

795
46:31.383 --> 46:32.583
Oh, whatever.

796
46:59.113 --> 47:00.213
I am hungry.

797
47:03.153 --> 47:04.953
(Welcome)

798
47:05.953 --> 47:08.893
- Hello. - Hey, student, you are here.

799
47:08.953 --> 47:11.053
Oh, I keep telling you I am not a student.

800
47:11.123 --> 47:13.593
- One spicy pork, please. - Got it, take a seat.

801
47:39.723 --> 47:41.083
- Eat up. - Thank you.

802
47:45.663 --> 47:47.893
What? Tak...

803
47:48.293 --> 47:49.863
Are you Tak Mu I?

804
47:50.833 --> 47:51.903
Hello.

805
47:52.463 --> 47:53.903
Oh, hi.

806
47:56.103 --> 47:58.743
Thanks to you, I enjoyed the lunchbox.

807
48:01.173 --> 48:03.113
Lunchbox?

808
48:03.443 --> 48:04.673
I have a question.

809
48:06.083 --> 48:07.483
How did you know?

810
48:07.983 --> 48:09.883
My house, my daily route.

811
48:11.783 --> 48:14.483
Do you happen to live in the same neighborhood as me?

812
48:16.853 --> 48:20.363
What? Oh, I do not know what you are talking about...

813
48:20.823 --> 48:23.333
You are the one who sent food to my house, right?

814
48:23.393 --> 48:24.563
Me?

815
48:24.893 --> 48:27.233
- Why would I do that? - How should I know?

816
48:27.433 --> 48:28.903
Probably because you are my fan.

817
48:29.273 --> 48:31.673
Oh, I am not your fan, Tak Mu I.

818
48:34.573 --> 48:35.573
I'm serious.

819
48:36.843 --> 48:40.313
Then if you are not a fan, why are you following me to my sets?

820
48:40.743 --> 48:41.813
And the convenience store...

821
48:42.953 --> 48:45.353
Did you get a job there knowing I go there often?

822
48:49.723 --> 48:52.963
Right, whatever it is, I would like you to stop now.

823
48:54.023 --> 48:55.933
Oh, I keep telling you it is not me.

824
48:55.963 --> 48:58.303
Why do you keep making me out to be some weirdo?

825
48:58.363 --> 49:01.673
So meeting here is just a coincidence too?

826
49:01.733 --> 49:05.543
What else would it be, destiny? I am a regular here too.

827
49:13.513 --> 49:14.913
Eat this.

828
49:15.013 --> 49:16.713
As you saw, I have not even touched it.

829
49:20.923 --> 49:21.993
What is his deal?

830
49:43.943 --> 49:46.043
What is going on? Did the young man leave?

831
49:47.513 --> 49:48.683
Here, please put it over here.

832
49:52.523 --> 49:53.853
It is so good.

833
49:57.693 --> 50:02.563
My, even though she is skinny, she sure has a hearty appetite.

834
50:05.633 --> 50:06.733
Excuse me.

835
50:06.833 --> 50:09.473
What did the man who just left order?

836
50:09.603 --> 50:10.703
He had the spicy pork.

837
50:18.543 --> 50:20.043
("Rooftop Romance")

838
50:21.043 --> 50:23.653
What? Hey.

839
50:24.153 --> 50:25.153
Over there...

840
50:26.923 --> 50:27.953
Hey, stop.

841
50:29.723 --> 50:33.023
Stalker fan, this is a filming set. Please leave.

842
50:33.123 --> 50:34.823
I am just going home.

843
50:34.863 --> 50:36.463
Hey, come on.

844
50:36.863 --> 50:38.533
Could you please move out of the way?

845
50:38.603 --> 50:40.863
I have been working all day without a wink of sleep,

846
50:40.933 --> 50:43.003
so I really do not have the energy to argue.

847
50:43.073 --> 50:46.343
Then stop following us around and exhausting us both.

848
50:46.403 --> 50:48.273
Oh, my, a moth. Go away!

849
50:48.343 --> 50:51.243
What is it? Oh, my, what is this?

850
51:10.933 --> 51:11.933
Goodness!

851
51:16.303 --> 51:17.673
What?

852
51:36.423 --> 51:37.723
Hey, are you okay?

853
51:44.233 --> 51:46.263
What is your name?

854
51:46.733 --> 51:48.063
Gong Yu Il.

855
51:49.573 --> 51:51.073
"Holiday?"

856
51:51.303 --> 51:54.473
No, not holiday, Yu Il.

857
51:54.543 --> 51:55.573
As in "only one."

858
51:56.643 --> 52:00.013
- Are you okay? - Do you think he is?

859
52:01.213 --> 52:02.713
I am sorry.

860
52:02.783 --> 52:04.153
Hey.

861
52:04.213 --> 52:06.423
Do you know what it feels like to have a moth fly into your mouth?

862
52:06.553 --> 52:07.553
I am sorry.

863
52:07.554 --> 52:11.553
It was flapping around and struggling to survive in there.

864
52:11.653 --> 52:15.463
Gosh, I could feel its legs and wings.

865
52:15.593 --> 52:18.433
And there is this powdery stuff coating my mouth and tongue.

866
52:18.503 --> 52:21.363
- Even if I brush, it feels gross. - Wait.

867
52:22.073 --> 52:24.003
If you need to go to the hospital,

868
52:24.033 --> 52:26.443
- I will pay your medical bills... - No.

869
52:26.503 --> 52:29.243
This was clearly an accident,

870
52:30.513 --> 52:32.113
so I will let it go.

871
52:32.143 --> 52:35.683
- Really? - But promise me one thing.

872
52:37.083 --> 52:38.553
What promise?

873
52:38.953 --> 52:41.583
Do not follow me around anymore.

874
52:42.953 --> 52:45.053
And no more food.

875
52:47.123 --> 52:48.423
Wait a minute.

876
52:49.093 --> 52:50.893
Let me be clear.

877
52:51.293 --> 52:53.103
That was not me.

878
52:53.363 --> 52:54.803
What do I have to do to make you believe me?

879
52:57.403 --> 52:58.803
Well...

880
52:58.843 --> 53:03.413
Do you not see this right here? I am a huge fan of Ryu Min.

881
53:04.813 --> 53:06.043
It really was not you?

882
53:06.083 --> 53:07.913
She must be a Revolving Door.

883
53:08.213 --> 53:11.583
- A Revolving Door? - You become a fan, spin, and leave.

884
53:11.653 --> 53:13.553
Join, leave, join, leave.

885
53:13.583 --> 53:15.823
People who switch favorites like it is nothing. Look here.

886
53:16.823 --> 53:18.823
Being a Revolving Door and stalking...

887
53:18.893 --> 53:20.163
That is not love!

888
53:21.763 --> 53:23.433
- Excuse me. - Yes.

889
53:23.533 --> 53:25.933
I am truly sorry about the moth.

890
53:26.033 --> 53:29.403
And I appreciate Tak Mu I being so understanding about it.

891
53:29.873 --> 53:31.173
However,

892
53:31.203 --> 53:34.573
both you and Tak Mu I remind me of something.

893
53:37.713 --> 53:39.513
Like an awful customer who speaks Japanese well,

894
53:39.583 --> 53:41.713
but cannot speak English.

895
53:44.513 --> 53:46.883
Wait, you mean me?

896
53:46.953 --> 53:49.953
- How so? - You keep stubbornly insisting.

897
53:50.053 --> 53:52.123
If you are going to be like this, go check the security cameras.

898
53:52.193 --> 53:54.393
- Stop falsely accusing me. - I did, but...

899
53:54.463 --> 53:55.993
- Hey. - Yes.

900
53:58.293 --> 53:59.333
Wait outside.

901
54:00.503 --> 54:01.503
Are you sure?

902
54:12.113 --> 54:13.413
If it was not you,

903
54:13.983 --> 54:15.083
I apologize.

904
54:24.693 --> 54:26.363
("Byeol I and Moon Bear" Volume 3)

905
54:27.763 --> 54:29.993
Oh, the door is this way...

906
54:30.063 --> 54:31.063
Wait...

907
54:34.363 --> 54:37.633
- Where did you get this? - Do not touch my things.

908
54:38.843 --> 54:40.073
Give it back, right now.

909
54:40.143 --> 54:41.302
If you tell me how an unpublished book...

910
54:41.303 --> 54:42.513
ended up here.

